# Tests are for whoever works on this, not for the people who install it.
# Without this they are packed into the extension and shipped — `extbk info`
# on 2.0.0 listed test/run.mjs among the modules.
test/

# Development notes and CI config are not extension content either. The
# packer already skips dotfiles, so .github is covered; this is for anything
# added later that is not hidden.
